{
 "about": "Notifications with the screen reader on in Spanish and from the keyboard (docs/adr/0039-keyboard-access.mdx, docs/adr/0026-notifications.mdx): Allo (sample/NotificationProbe.tsx) posts; its banner is said politely once, its close named by the notification it closes (\"Ocultar la notificación de Allo: Ana\", not a bare verb). The banner stays while the pointer is on it and five seconds after it leaves, as a Mac's; while a reply is typed in it, it stays, Tab reaching its Enviar. Super+N, as a Mac's Fn-N, opens the Notification Center: a dialog said by its title, the keyboard on its first control said after it; Tab through a notification and its close, each said once; Escape closes it and gives Allo the keyboard back; Super+N again closes it. At 1 (1280 × 720).",
 "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
 "module": "NotificationProbe",
 "window": [
  600,
  360
 ],
 "shell": "OxyOSShell",
 "app": {
  "id": "so.oxy.allo",
  "title": "Allo"
 },
 "reader": {},
 "steps": [
  {
   "name": "Allo's window; the reader on",
   "do": [
    "wait",
    1500
   ],
   "expect": {
    "react": {},
    "keyboard_focus": null,
    "spoken": [],
    "announcements": [],
    "at_absent": {
     "shell": [
      {
       "name": "Allo. Ana. ¿Comemos juntos?"
      },
      {
       "name": "Ocultar la notificación de Allo: Ana"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "allow_unchanged": true
  },
  {
   "name": "Avisar posts one: its banner, said politely once; its close named by the notification it closes",
